    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Late Ming Dynasty: The Realm of Abyss&quot; is a soul-like action role-playing game. The story takes place on the back of the moon. It is the dark and turbulent end of the Ming Dynasty. Wars are raging everywhere. A mysterious plague has spawned monster-like creatures... The player will become Wuchang, a female guest with amnesia. Under the torture of the terrible Yuhua disease, she will uncover the secrets of her own...</p>",
